# Absolute URL of the deployed QIDS backend API (no trailing slash).
# Required for production (Vercel). When unset, the frontend falls back
# to a relative "/api" path, which only works with the local Vite dev
# server's proxy (see vite.config.ts) -- it will NOT work in a Vercel
# production build if left unset, since there is no backend behind the
# Vercel domain itself.
VITE_API_URL=https://your-qids-api.example.com
